(LST2-29 — `append <value> to <list>` adds the value to the END of the
 list and grows its length by one. The manual's own "Appending to Lists"
 block, verbatim.
 Also covers: LST2-30 (the worked example's length of 5), LST2-31
 (`append <value> to <list>` appends exactly one element).
